  "Level {n} · {n} HP · attacks every {n} s (brave) · {*}": "等級 {n} · {n} HP · 每 {n} 秒攻擊一次（勇敢）· {*}",
  "Level {n} · {n} HP · attacks every {n} s": "等級 {n} · {n} HP · 每 {n} 秒攻擊一次",
  "Level {n} · {n} HP · attacks every {n} s (brave)": "等級 {n} · {n} HP · 每 {n} 秒攻擊一次（勇敢）",
  "How the simulation works": "模擬怎麼算",
  "One fight, turn by turn": "一場戰鬥，逐回合計算",
  "Each turn a boss checks its skills in order. A skill fires when its cooldown is over, its chance roll passes, its HP and distance conditions match and the boss has the MP. Otherwise it attacks normally. Its next turn comes after its attack or casting time, 25% sooner when it is hasted or brave.": "每一回合 Boss 會依序檢查牠的技能。冷卻結束、機率判定通過、HP 與距離條件符合、MP 足夠時技能就會發動，否則就普通攻擊。下一回合在牠的攻擊或施法時間之後到來，加速或勇敢狀態下會提早 25%。",
  "Physical hits": "物理攻擊",
  "Your AC decides how often a boss hits. DG dodges melee (every 10 DG shown in game is 1%) and ER dodges ranged attacks. When a hit lands, your class reduces it by a random amount based on your AC (Knight up to AC÷2, Royal and Elf AC÷3, Dark Elf and Dragon Knight AC÷4, Mage and Illusionist AC÷5), then DR comes off.": "你的 AC 決定 Boss 多常打中你。DG 迴避近戰（遊戲裡顯示的每 10 DG 等於 1%），ER 迴避遠距攻擊。被打中時，你的職業會依 AC 隨機減免一部分（騎士最高 AC÷2，王族與妖精 AC÷3，黑暗妖精與龍騎士 AC÷4，法師與幻術師 AC÷5），然後再扣 DR。",
  "Spells": "魔法",
  "Spell damage grows with the boss's INT. DR comes off first. Then your MR is the percent chance to halve it: at 100 MR every boss spell is halved, and MR above 100 does not help further. Elemental resistance lowers spells of that element.": "魔法傷害隨 Boss 的 INT 增加。先扣 DR，接著你的 MR 是把傷害減半的百分比機率：MR 100 時 Boss 的每個魔法都減半，超過 100 不再有額外效果。屬性抗性會降低該屬性的魔法傷害。",
  "Stat buffs (AC, MR, DG, ER, resistances, HP) are added to your numbers before the fight. Reduction Armor, Dragon Skin (×0.7 against monsters), Patience and Immune to Harm reduce every hit, melee and magic. Counter Barrier cancels an adjacent melee hit with a chance of 20% plus your levels above the boss, up to 40%. Only one of Shield, Shadow Armor, Earth Skin, Earth Bless and Iron Skin can be active, as in game; the same goes for the two royal auras and the three Awaken spells.": "能力值類的輔助魔法（AC、MR、DG、ER、抗性、HP）在戰鬥前就加進你的數值。增幅防禦、龍之護鎧（對怪物 ×0.7）、耐力與聖結界會減少每一次近戰與魔法的傷害。反擊屏障有 20% 加上你高於 Boss 的等級數的機率抵銷相鄰的近戰攻擊，最高 40%。保護罩、影之防護、大地防護、大地的祝福、鋼鐵防護和遊戲裡一樣只能擇一生效；王族的兩種光輝與三種覺醒魔法也是。",
  "Reading the numbers": "怎麼看數字",
  "is what you lose on average while the boss is healthy, at half HP and below 10%, since some bosses unlock skills as they weaken.": "是 Boss 在健康、半血與低於 10% 時，你平均每秒損失的 HP，因為有些 Boss 血量變低會解鎖技能。",
  "HP lost in worst 5 s": "最慘 5 秒損失的 HP",
  "is how much HP the heaviest 5-second stretch of a fight takes, when several strong skills land close together. It is the typical worst stretch across the simulated fights, one-shots excluded. Compare it with your HP and potion speed: if it is close to your HP, one bad streak can kill you even when the per-second number looks safe.": "是一場戰鬥裡最重的 5 秒會打掉多少 HP，也就是幾個強力技能連著命中的時候。這是多場模擬戰中典型的最慘區間，不含一擊必殺。拿它和你的 HP、喝水速度比一比：如果接近你的 HP，就算每秒數字看起來安全，一波連擊還是可能讓你倒下。",
  "One-shot": "一擊必殺",
  "hits are single hits at least as large as your max HP. They are counted on their own and left out of the per-second numbers.": "是單下傷害不低於你最大 HP 的攻擊。它們單獨計算，不算進每秒數字。",
  "Which bosses are listed": "列出哪些 Boss",
  ": bosses that pressure you less than Wanted Criminal Kuzak with your current settings are left out, including bosses that never fight back.": "：在你目前的設定下，威脅比通緝犯庫傑還低的 Boss 不會列出，包含完全不會反擊的 Boss。",
  "Time to drop you": "撐多久會倒",
  "is how long your full HP lasts with no healing, using the boss's most dangerous HP stage and counting each one-shot as your full HP.": "是不補血的情況下你的滿 HP 能撐多久，以 Boss 最危險的血量階段計算，每次一擊必殺都算成你的滿 HP。",
  "Not included": "沒有計入",
  "Summoned minions, poison, stuns and other debuffs, special scripted phases, the undead night bonus (+10% melee from undead bosses at night), TOI hard mode, champions, and your buffs, runes, dolls and cooking. Each boss runs 12 simulated 3-minute fights per HP stage, so numbers can shift slightly between settings.": "召喚出來的小怪、中毒、暈眩與其他負面狀態、特殊劇本階段、不死系夜間加成（夜晚不死系 Boss 近戰 +10%）、傲慢之塔困難模式、冠軍怪物，以及你的輔助魔法、符文、魔法娃娃與料理。每隻 Boss 在每個血量階段跑 12 場 3 分鐘的模擬戰，所以不同設定之間數字會略有浮動。",
